  "views": {
    "hero": "side",
    "reads": {
      "front": "Beam points at the camera: the orb grows into a bright disk, then the beam reads as a flaring circle with arcs radiating outward. Shows the charge-up best.",
      "side": "Hero view. Full length of the beam from hand to end point, wobble and peeling arcs visible, spark fountain at the far end.",
      "top": "The beam is a straight line on the ground plane; its length and the end ring show the area it covers. Inflow arcs read as spokes pulling into the orb. A rune circle spins up under the caster while charging, and the beam burns a streak into the ground where it ends.",
      "three_quarter": "Beam recedes diagonally into the scene, with both its length and its width visible. The rune circle reads as a glowing ellipse under the caster."
    }
  },
